   - `<DataSourceReferences />`
   - `<DataSources />`
   - `<Parts />`
   - `<PropertyModifications />`

4. **Improved Code Documentation**
   - Added XML documentation comments (`///`) to all event handler methods
   - Clear parameter descriptions
   - Better method summaries

